    [6695]={name="Stygian Bone Amulet",quality=3,ilvl=34,reqLevel=29,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Blind Hunter.",zone="Razorfen Kraul",npc="Blind Hunter"},
    [6697]={name="Batwing Mantle",quality=3,ilvl=34,reqLevel=29,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Blind Hunter.",zone="Razorfen Kraul",npc="Blind Hunter"},
    [6709]={name="Moonglow Vest",quality=2,ilvl=18,reqLevel=13,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Leatherworking (requires skill 1).",profession="Leatherworking"},
    [6719]={name="Windborne Belt",quality=2,ilvl=30,reqLevel=25,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Highperch Venom'. Starts with Fiora Longears in Dustwallow Marsh. Objective: Bring 10 Highperch Venom Sacs to Fiora Longears in Theramore.",zone="Dustwallow Marsh",questName="Highperch Venom",lore="As you may know, wyverns are often tamed by orcs for use as mounts. But what is less known is that the venom of a wyvern, in some circles, is more valuable than the beast itself."},
    [6720]={name="Spirit Hunter Headdress",quality=2,ilvl=37,reqLevel=26,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Frostmaw'. Starts with Melor Stonehoof in Thunder Bluff. Objective: Bring Frostmaw's Mane to Melor Stonehoof in Thunder Bluff.",zone="Thunder Bluff",questName="Frostmaw",lore="it is now time for you to travel to far-off lands. You are ready. You now hunt Frostmaw, a yeti in the Alterac Mountains. He is elusive, his white coat blending into the snows of his mountain home."},
    [6722]={name="Beastial Manacles",quality=2,ilvl=30,reqLevel=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Fallen Sky Lake'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Pelturas Whitemoon in Ashenvale. Objective: Retrieve a Fallen Moonstone from the Shadethicket Oracle, then bring it to Pelturas in Astranaar.",zone="Ashenvale",questName="Fallen Sky Lake",lore="Relara's fever has passed, but she is still very weak. I do not believe time alone will give her back the strength she has lost. I believe it will take the power of a moonstone."},
    [6725]={name="Marbled Buckler",quality=3,ilvl=36,reqLevel=29,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Crone of the Kraul'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Razorfen Kraul",questName="The Crone of the Kraul",lore="Poor Heralath! And this dwarf... Lonebrow. What a brave soul he was. We must not let their valiance go for naught. This crone... Charlga Razorflank..."},
    [6726]={name="Razzeric's Customized Seatbelt",quality=2,ilvl=41,reqLevel=29,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Safety First'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Shreev in Thousand Needles. Objective: Return the Modified Seaforium Booster to Razzeric on the Shimmering Flats.",zone="Thousand Needles",questName="Safety First",lore="There, I did what Razzeric wanted. Just tell him to be careful when he sets this off. If he makes the slightest mistake, he won't be moving forward, he'll just be a burnt spot on the track."},
    [6727]={name="Razzeric's Racing Grips",quality=2,ilvl=41,reqLevel=29,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Safety First'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Shreev in Thousand Needles. Objective: Return the Modified Seaforium Booster to Razzeric on the Shimmering Flats.",zone="Thousand Needles",questName="Safety First",lore="There, I did what Razzeric wanted. Just tell him to be careful when he sets this off. If he makes the slightest mistake, he won't be moving forward, he'll just be a burnt spot on the track."},
    [6732]={name="Gnomish Mechanic's Gloves",quality=2,ilvl=38,reqLevel=28,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'News for Fizzle'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Martek the Exiled in Thousand Needles. Objective: Speak with Fizzle Brassbolts in the Shimmering Flats.",zone="Thousand Needles",questName="News for Fizzle",lore="Indurium has an amazing resistance to heat! I'm sure it will work for Fizzle's pistons. But he'll need true indurium ore, not just the flakes."},
    [6738]={name="Bleeding Crescent",quality=2,ilvl=35,reqLevel=28,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Parts of the Swarm'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Korran in Orgrimmar. Objective: Return to Belgrom Rockmaul in Orgrimmar.",zone="Thousand Needles",questName="Parts of the Swarm",lore="Head back to Belgrom in Orgrimmar and tell him Moktar be doing his bidding well out in the Thousand Needles. Tell him also, that me studies progress, and I hope to be havin' learned more soon.",proc="Chance on hit: Wounds the target causing them to bleed for 45 damage over 30 sec."},
    [6740]={name="Azure Sash",quality=2,ilvl=29,reqLevel=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Sacred Flame'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Rau Cliffrunner in Thousand Needles. Objective: Retrieve the Cloven Hoof for Rau Cliffrunner at the Freewind Post.",zone="Thunder Bluff",questName="The Sacred Flame",lore="Using the water you brought, you will be able to temporarily douse the flame that holds the centaur relic. It will not work permanently, however, so you will have to be quick about it."},
    [6742]={name="Stonefist Girdle",quality=3,ilvl=36,reqLevel=29,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Crone of the Kraul'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Razorfen Kraul",questName="The Crone of the Kraul",lore="Poor Heralath! And this dwarf... Lonebrow. What a brave soul he was. We must not let their valiance go for naught. This crone... Charlga Razorflank..."},
    [6743]={name="Sustaining Ring",quality=2,ilvl=25,reqLevel=10,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Knowledge in the Deeps'. Starts with Gerrig Bonegrip in Ironforge. Objective: Bring the Lorgalis Manuscript to Gerrig Bonegrip in the Forlorn Cavern in Ironforge.",zone="Blackfathom Deeps",questName="Knowledge in the Deeps",lore="As you might know, I collect lore. Old lore. Powerful lore. Lore that opens doorways, and lore that can awaken Those Who Sleep."},
    [6744]={name="Gloves of Kapelan",quality=2,ilvl=33,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Alliance Relations'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Takata Steelblade in Orgrimmar. Objective: Speak to Keldran in Orgrimmar.",zone="Orgrimmar",questName="Alliance Relations",lore="The fight goes well. Perhaps the Warchief will allow us to return to our homes before the seasons change if we continue to make such great strides in our battle against the demons and their underlings."},
    [6745]={name="Swiftrunner Cape",quality=2,ilvl=33,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Alliance Relations'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Takata Steelblade in Orgrimmar. Objective: Speak to Keldran in Orgrimmar.",zone="Orgrimmar",questName="Alliance Relations",lore="The fight goes well. Perhaps the Warchief will allow us to return to our homes before the seasons change if we continue to make such great strides in our battle against the demons and their underlings."},
    [6746]={name="Basalt Buckler",quality=2,ilvl=40,reqLevel=25,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Corrupter'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Takata Steelblade in Desolace. Objective: Slay Lord Azrethoc and Jugkar Grim'rod and return to Takata Steelblade in Desolace.",zone="Desolace",questName="The Corrupter",lore="Although I have no knowledge of this Lord Azrethoc, I agree with Maurin, he must be stopped; especially if he is attempting to gain influence over the Burning Blade to further his goals."},
    [6747]={name="Enforcer Pauldrons",quality=2,ilvl=40,reqLevel=25,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Corrupter'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Takata Steelblade in Desolace. Objective: Slay Lord Azrethoc and Jugkar Grim'rod and return to Takata Steelblade in Desolace.",zone="Desolace",questName="The Corrupter",lore="Although I have no knowledge of this Lord Azrethoc, I agree with Maurin, he must be stopped; especially if he is attempting to gain influence over the Burning Blade to further his goals."},
    [6748]={name="Monkey Ring",quality=2,ilvl=32,reqLevel=22,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Willix the Importer'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Razorfen Kraul",questName="Willix the Importer",lore="At last, help has arrived! You have no clue how long I've been held prisoner here. I can't remember the last time I saw the outside of this place."},
    [6750]={name="Snake Hoop",quality=2,ilvl=32,reqLevel=22,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Willix the Importer'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Razorfen Kraul",questName="Willix the Importer",lore="At last, help has arrived! You have no clue how long I've been held prisoner here. I can't remember the last time I saw the outside of this place."},
    [6752]={name="Lancer Boots",quality=2,ilvl=32,reqLevel=25,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Mortality Wanes'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Razorfen Kraul",questName="Mortality Wanes",lore="I have not long to live... so... so... weak....the b-b-brave dwarf, Lonebrow, has been sent to w-w-warn Falfindel... But before I... d-d-die......my wife, Treshala..."},
    [6757]={name="Jaina's Signet Ring",quality=2,ilvl=38,reqLevel=28,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Missing Diplomat'. Starts with Tapoke \\\"Slim\\\" Jahn in Wetlands. Objective: Speak to Mikhail in the Wetlands.",zone="Stormwind City",questName="The Missing Diplomat"},
    [6773]={name="Gelkis Marauder Chain",quality=2,ilvl=42,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Khan Hratha'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Uthek the Wise in Desolace. Objective: Maintain your reputation with the Gelkis, and bring the Maraudine Key Fragment to Uthek the Wise in the Gelkis Village.",zone="Desolace",questName="Khan Hratha",lore="you helped us against the Magram. Now, help us beat the Maraudine! Kill the head of their clan, Khan Hratha! To face him, blow the Maraudine War Horn."},
    [6780]={name="Lilac Sash",quality=2,ilvl=36,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Centaur Bounty'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Corporal Melkins in Desolace. Objective: Bring 15 Centaur Ears to Corporal Melkins at Nijel's Point in Desolace.",zone="Desolace",questName="Centaur Bounty",lore="Now that you scared the centaur clans, it's time to bleed them. When traveling Desolace, hunt centaur. I don't care which clan you hunt. Just gather ears."},
    [6784]={name="Braced Handguards",quality=2,ilvl=36,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Centaur Bounty'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Corporal Melkins in Desolace. Objective: Bring 15 Centaur Ears to Corporal Melkins at Nijel's Point in Desolace.",zone="Desolace",questName="Centaur Bounty",lore="Now that you scared the centaur clans, it's time to bleed them. When traveling Desolace, hunt centaur. I don't care which clan you hunt. Just gather ears."},
    [6788]={name="Magram Hunter's Belt",quality=2,ilvl=42,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Khan Hratha'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Uthek the Wise in Desolace. Objective: Maintain your reputation with the Gelkis, and bring the Maraudine Key Fragment to Uthek the Wise in the Gelkis Village.",zone="Desolace",questName="Khan Hratha",lore="The Gelkis Khan is dead, and now the Maraudine will fall! Kill the Maraudine Khan, Hratha! To face him, blow the horn on the high bluff in the Valley of Spears."},
    [6789]={name="Ceremonial Centaur Blanket",quality=2,ilvl=42,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Khan Hratha'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Uthek the Wise in Desolace. Objective: Maintain your reputation with the Gelkis, and bring the Maraudine Key Fragment to Uthek the Wise in the Gelkis Village.",zone="Desolace",questName="Khan Hratha",lore="But to blow the horn, you need a mouthpiece. To get a mouthpiece, kill Maraudine centaur."},
    [6791]={name="Hellion Boots",quality=2,ilvl=40,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Karnitol Shipwreck'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Desolace. Objective: Return to Kreldig Ungor in Desolace.",zone="Desolace",questName="The Karnitol Shipwreck",lore="Take Karnitol's things back to Roetten in Ironforge and he'll pay you for a job well done. Haha, if you're not careful, he's gonna be so pleased with ya that he'll ask you to join us full time."},
    [6793]={name="Auric Bracers",quality=2,ilvl=40,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Reagents for Reclaimers Inc.'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Kreldig Ungor in Ironforge. Objective: Bring Leftwitch's Package back to Roetten Stonehammer in Ironforge.",zone="Desolace",questName="Reagents for Reclaimers Inc.",lore="To get paid, you're gonna have to get back to Ironforge and speak to Roetten himself. He'll love getting Leftwitch's package out of the way anyway."},
    [6794]={name="Stormfire Gauntlets",quality=2,ilvl=40,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Reagents for Reclaimers Inc.'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Kreldig Ungor in Ironforge. Objective: Bring Leftwitch's Package back to Roetten Stonehammer in Ironforge.",zone="Desolace",questName="Reagents for Reclaimers Inc.",lore="To get paid, you're gonna have to get back to Ironforge and speak to Roetten himself. He'll love getting Leftwitch's package out of the way anyway."},
    [6801]={name="Baroque Apron",quality=2,ilvl=40,reqLevel=33,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest '... and Bugs'. Starts with Morgan Stern in Dustwallow Marsh. Objective: Bring 12 Pristine Crawler Legs to Morgan Stern in Theramore.",zone="Dustwallow Marsh",questName="... and Bugs",lore="Another component of my new recipe is the shelled leg of a giant crab. And the crabs they have in Dustwallow -- Muckshells they call them -- just won't do!"},
    [6828]={name="Visionary Buckler",quality=2,ilvl=38,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Galen's Escape'. Starts with Galen Goodward in Swamp of Sorrows. Objective: Escort Galen out of danger, then find his camp in the Swamp of Sorrows and open his strongbox.",zone="Swamp of Sorrows",questName="Galen's Escape",lore="Please help! These creatures are going to eat me! Help me out of here, and I'll give you a great treasure! It's in my camp in the swamp north of Stonard, but it's locked in a strongbox that can be opened through a trick that only I know."},
    [6830]={name="Bonebiter",quality=3,ilvl=44,reqLevel=34,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'In the Name of the Light'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Raleigh the Devout in Scarlet Monastery. Objective: Kill High Inquisitor Whitemane, Scarlet Commander Mograine, Herod, the Scarlet Champion and Houndmaster Loksey and then report back to Raleigh the Devout in Southshore.",zone="Scarlet Monastery",questName="In the Name of the Light",lore="I once served the Scarlet Crusade with honor, loyalty and pride. I believed their cause to be a noble one: to rid Azeroth of the undead."},
    [6831]={name="Black Menace",quality=3,ilvl=44,reqLevel=34,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'In the Name of the Light'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Raleigh the Devout in Scarlet Monastery. Objective: Kill High Inquisitor Whitemane, Scarlet Commander Mograine, Herod, the Scarlet Champion and Houndmaster Loksey and then report back to Raleigh the Devout in Southshore.",zone="Scarlet Monastery",questName="In the Name of the Light",lore="I once served the Scarlet Crusade with honor, loyalty and pride. I believed their cause to be a noble one: to rid Azeroth of the undead."},
