    [9520]={name="Silent Hunter",quality=2,ilvl=41,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Call to Arms'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Drum Fel in Arathi Highlands. Objective: Kill 10 Boulderfist Brutes and 4 Boulderfist Magi, and return to Drum Fel in the Hammerfall outpost.",zone="Arathi Highlands",questName="Call to Arms",lore="The head of the beast is ready to be taken off... with great force. You have shown every sign that you are able to help us with this final mighty blow."},
    [9521]={name="Skullsplitter",quality=2,ilvl=41,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Call to Arms'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Drum Fel in Arathi Highlands. Objective: Kill 10 Boulderfist Brutes and 4 Boulderfist Magi, and return to Drum Fel in the Hammerfall outpost.",zone="Arathi Highlands",questName="Call to Arms",lore="The head of the beast is ready to be taken off... with great force. You have shown every sign that you are able to help us with this final mighty blow."},
    [9522]={name="Energized Stone Circle",quality=2,ilvl=36,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Power Stones'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Rigglefuzz in Badlands. Objective: Bring 8 Dentrium Power Stones and 8 An'Alleum Power Stones to Rigglefuzz in the Badlands.",zone="Uldaman",questName="Power Stones",lore="A while ago, I had an incident with the Shadowforge Dwarves. They brought me to Angor Fortress to study two types of strange stones from Uldaman."},
    [9527]={name="Spellshifter Rod",quality=3,ilvl=46,reqLevel=40,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Tiara of the Deep'. Starts with Tabetha in Dustwallow Marsh. Objective: Bring the Tiara of the Deep to Tabetha in Dustwallow Marsh.",zone="Zul'Farrak",questName="Tiara of the Deep",lore="Long ago I possessed a beautiful piece of jewelry, the Tiara of the Deep. And not only was it pretty--it held great power for those with the knowledge to use it."},
    [9533]={name="Masons Fraternity Ring",quality=3,ilvl=49,reqLevel=40,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Divino-matic Rod'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle in Tanaris. Objective: Bring the Divino-matic Rod to Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle in Gadgetzan.",zone="Zul'Farrak",questName="Divino-matic Rod",lore="Sergeant Bly stole from me! He said he'd only borrow it, but he stole my cherished divino-matic rod!! Without that rod how will I know where to dig new water holes??"},
    [9534]={name="Engineer's Guild Headpiece",quality=3,ilvl=47,reqLevel=40,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Divino-matic Rod'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle in Tanaris. Objective: Bring the Divino-matic Rod to Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle in Gadgetzan.",zone="Zul'Farrak",questName="Divino-matic Rod",lore="Sergeant Bly stole from me! He said he'd only borrow it, but he stole my cherished divino-matic rod!! Without that rod how will I know where to dig new water holes??"},
    [9536]={name="Fairywing Mantle",quality=3,ilvl=30,reqLevel=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'A Fine Mess'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Kernobee in Stranglethorn Vale. Objective: Escort Kernobee to the Clockwerk Run exit and then report to Scooty in Booty Bay.",zone="Gnomeregan",questName="A Fine Mess",lore="Wha.. What happened? The last thing I remember is being captured by a group of dark iron dwarves, beaten to within an inch of my life and then thrown in here with these filthy troggs."},
    [9538]={name="Talvash's Gold Ring",quality=3,ilvl=37,reqLevel=28,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Gnome Improvement'.",zone="Ironforge",questName="Gnome Improvement",lore="Listen, that ring is yours, sure..."},
    [9601]={name="Cushioned Boots",quality=1,ilvl=12,reqLevel=5,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Sathrah's Sacrifice'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Priestess A'moora in Darnassus. Objective: Priestess A'moora wants you to place Lady Sathrah's silvery spinnerets at the fountain inside the temple, and then return to her.",zone="Darnassus",questName="Sathrah's Sacrifice",lore="Now you must finish the task to which you have been appointed. Take the spinnerets and offer Lady Sathrah's sacrifice to Elune; lay the great spider to rest."},
    [9604]={name="Mechanic's Pipehammer",quality=2,ilvl=30,reqLevel=25,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Data Rescue'. Starts with Master Mechanic Castpipe in Ironforge. Objective: Bring a Prismatic Punch Card to Master Mechanic Castpipe in Ironforge.",zone="Gnomeregan",questName="Data Rescue",lore="When we fled Gnomeregan, we left so much data behind! Vitally important data! I need the data on a prismatic punch card, from a Matrix Punchograph 3005-D high security terminal, deep in Gnomeregan."},
    [9605]={name="Repairman's Cape",quality=3,ilvl=30,reqLevel=25,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Data Rescue'. Starts with Master Mechanic Castpipe in Ironforge. Objective: Bring a Prismatic Punch Card to Master Mechanic Castpipe in Ironforge.",zone="Gnomeregan",questName="Data Rescue",lore="When we fled Gnomeregan, we left so much data behind! Vitally important data! I need the data on a prismatic punch card, from a Matrix Punchograph 3005-D high security terminal, deep in Gnomeregan."},
    [9609]={name="Shilly Mitts",quality=2,ilvl=32,reqLevel=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Gyrodrillmatic Excavationators'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Shoni the Shilent in Stormwind City. Objective: Bring twenty-four Robo-mechanical Guts to Shoni in Stormwind.",zone="Gnomeregan",questName="Gyrodrillmatic Excavationators",lore="It's terrible. We are not going to have enough parts to get our fleet of gyrodrillmatic excavationators to Dun Morogh. What we need are spare parts."},
    [9622]={name="Reedknot Ring",quality=2,ilvl=35,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Jarl Needs a Blade'. Starts with \\\"Swamp Eye\\\" Jarl in Dustwallow Marsh. Objective: Bring a Moonsteel Broadsword to Jarl in Dustwallow Marsh.",zone="Dustwallow Marsh",questName="Jarl Needs a Blade",lore="I have cutting to do. I can't tell you what I'm going to cut, but... I need myself a blade. A certain blade... Some people call it a sword. I call it a swing blade."},
    [9623]={name="Civinad Robes",quality=3,ilvl=37,reqLevel=25,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Rig Wars'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Nogg in Orgrimmar. Objective: Retrieve the Rig Blueprints and Thermaplugg's Safe Combination from Gnomeregan and bring them to Nogg in Orgrimmar.",zone="Gnomeregan",questName="Rig Wars",lore="Gnome technology - two years ago its most common use was as a punch line. Times certainly have changed. Now they've got a new rig built that's better than all our shredder models combined."},
    [9624]={name="Triprunner Dungarees",quality=3,ilvl=37,reqLevel=25,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Rig Wars'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Nogg in Orgrimmar. Objective: Retrieve the Rig Blueprints and Thermaplugg's Safe Combination from Gnomeregan and bring them to Nogg in Orgrimmar.",zone="Gnomeregan",questName="Rig Wars",lore="Gnome technology - two years ago its most common use was as a punch line. Times certainly have changed. Now they've got a new rig built that's better than all our shredder models combined."},
    [9625]={name="Dual Reinforced Leggings",quality=3,ilvl=37,reqLevel=25,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Rig Wars'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Nogg in Orgrimmar. Objective: Retrieve the Rig Blueprints and Thermaplugg's Safe Combination from Gnomeregan and bring them to Nogg in Orgrimmar.",zone="Gnomeregan",questName="Rig Wars",lore="Gnome technology - two years ago its most common use was as a punch line. Times certainly have changed. Now they've got a new rig built that's better than all our shredder models combined."},
    [9626]={name="Dwarven Charge",quality=2,ilvl=42,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Hidden Chamber'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Baelog in Ironforge. Objective: Read Baelog's Journal, explore the hidden chamber, then report to Prospector Stormpike.",zone="Uldaman",questName="The Hidden Chamber",lore="Now for the task at hand. There is a secret chamber, the Chamber of Khaz'mul, that must be explored. The problem is that the chamber's behind a huge, locked door!"},
    [9630]={name="Pratt's Handcrafted Boots",quality=2,ilvl=45,reqLevel=40,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Mark of Quality'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Jangdor Swiftstrider in Feralas. Objective: Bring 10 Thick Yeti Hides to Jangdor Swiftstrider in Camp Mojache.",zone="Feralas",questName="The Mark of Quality",lore="My philosophy on leatherworking is that the work must be the best quality possible - no compromises. Anyone who says that quality doesn't matter is trying to sell you ocean-front property in Dun Morogh!"},
    [9631]={name="Pratt's Handcrafted Gloves",quality=2,ilvl=45,reqLevel=40,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Mark of Quality'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Jangdor Swiftstrider in Feralas. Objective: Bring 10 Thick Yeti Hides to Jangdor Swiftstrider in Camp Mojache.",zone="Feralas",questName="The Mark of Quality",lore="My philosophy on leatherworking is that the work must be the best quality possible - no compromises. Anyone who says that quality doesn't matter is trying to sell you ocean-front property in Dun Morogh!"},
    [9632]={name="Jangdor's Handcrafted Gloves",quality=2,ilvl=45,reqLevel=40,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Mark of Quality'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Jangdor Swiftstrider in Feralas. Objective: Bring 10 Thick Yeti Hides to Jangdor Swiftstrider in Camp Mojache.",zone="Feralas",questName="The Mark of Quality",lore="I take pride in my leather work, and I feel it shows; quality should never be compromised. Anyone who says that quality doesn't matter would also have you believe that the earth does not keep secrets!"},
    [9633]={name="Jangdor's Handcrafted Boots",quality=2,ilvl=45,reqLevel=40,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Mark of Quality'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Jangdor Swiftstrider in Feralas. Objective: Bring 10 Thick Yeti Hides to Jangdor Swiftstrider in Camp Mojache.",zone="Feralas",questName="The Mark of Quality",lore="I take pride in my leather work, and I feel it shows; quality should never be compromised. Anyone who says that quality doesn't matter would also have you believe that the earth does not keep secrets!"},
    [9634]={name="Skilled Handling Gloves",quality=2,ilvl=46,reqLevel=38,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Return to Apothecary Zinge'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle in Undercity. Objective: Bring the Sealed Field Testing Kit to Apothecary Zinge in the Undercity.",zone="Undercity",questName="Return to Apothecary Zinge",lore="\"Here you go, the power source is safely removed and the data is preserved. Well, safe journeys and all that."},
    [9635]={name="Master Apothecary Cape",quality=2,ilvl=45,reqLevel=38,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Return to Apothecary Zinge'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle in Undercity. Objective: Bring the Sealed Field Testing Kit to Apothecary Zinge in the Undercity.",zone="Undercity",questName="Return to Apothecary Zinge",lore="You secure the sealed testing kit for the journey back to the Undercity. Apothecary Zinge waits for you and the sealed field testing kit there."},
    [9638]={name="Chelonian Cuffs",quality=2,ilvl=50,reqLevel=40,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Tooga's Quest'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Tanaris. Objective: Show Tooga the way back to his wife, Torta.",zone="Tanaris",questName="Tooga's Quest",lore="I am so lost! My wife, Torta, sent me out to fetch dinner and I must have taken a wrong turn somewhere. Would you be so kind as to lead me back to Torta?"},
    [9639]={name="The Hand of Antu'sul",quality=3,ilvl=48,reqLevel=43,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Antu'sul.",zone="Zul'Farrak",npc="Antu'sul",proc="Chance on hit: Blasts nearby enemies with thunder increasing the time between their attacks by 11% for 10 sec and doing 7 Nature damage to them. Â Will affect up to 4 targets."},
    [9643]={name="Optomatic Deflector",quality=2,ilvl=51,reqLevel=43,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Rescue OOX-17/TN!'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Tanaris",questName="Rescue OOX-17/TN!",lore="The gnome's voice crackles once again from the robot: \"I need to move OOX-17/TN to an open, safe place so it can begin a lengthy take-off procedure."},
    [9647]={name="Failed Flying Experiment",quality=2,ilvl=48,reqLevel=40,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Rescue OOX-22/FE!'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Feralas",questName="Rescue OOX-22/FE!",lore="The gnome's voice crackles once again from the robot: \"I need to move OOX-22/FE to an open, safe place so it can begin a lengthy take-off procedure."},
    [9648]={name="Chainlink Towel",quality=2,ilvl=48,reqLevel=40,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Rescue OOX-22/FE!'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Feralas",questName="Rescue OOX-22/FE!",lore="The gnome's voice crackles once again from the robot: \"I need to move OOX-22/FE to an open, safe place so it can begin a lengthy take-off procedure."},
    [9649]={name="Royal Highmark Vestments",quality=2,ilvl=55,reqLevel=40,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Venom to the Undercity'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Apothecary Lydon. Objective: Bring Faranell's Parcel to Master Apothecary Faranell in the Undercity.",zone="The Hinterlands",questName="Venom to the Undercity",lore="The venom you gathered from the Witherbark's spider god is quite a find! I've been able to kill nearly two dozen rabbits with just a drop of the stuff."},
    [9650]={name="Honorguard Chestpiece",quality=2,ilvl=55,reqLevel=40,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Venom to the Undercity'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Apothecary Lydon. Objective: Bring Faranell's Parcel to Master Apothecary Faranell in the Undercity.",zone="The Hinterlands",questName="Venom to the Undercity",lore="The venom you gathered from the Witherbark's spider god is quite a find! I've been able to kill nearly two dozen rabbits with just a drop of the stuff."},
    [9651]={name="Gryphon Rider's Stormhammer",quality=2,ilvl=53,reqLevel=40,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Saving Sharpbeak'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Gryphon Master Talonaxe in The Hinterlands. Objective: Fight to the top of Jintha'Alor, kill Vile Priestess Hexx for the key to Sharpbeak's cage, and save Sharpbeak.",zone="The Hinterlands",questName="Saving Sharpbeak",lore="We must save Sharpbeak! Fight your way to the top of Jintha'Alor in the heart of Vilebranch territory, gain the key to Sharpbeak's cage from the vile Priestess Hexx, and then find and save Sharpbeak!",proc="Chance on hit: Blasts a target for 91 to 125 Nature damage."},
    [9652]={name="Gryphon Rider's Leggings",quality=2,ilvl=53,reqLevel=40,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Saving Sharpbeak'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Gryphon Master Talonaxe in The Hinterlands. Objective: Fight to the top of Jintha'Alor, kill Vile Priestess Hexx for the key to Sharpbeak's cage, and save Sharpbeak.",zone="The Hinterlands",questName="Saving Sharpbeak",lore="We must save Sharpbeak! Fight your way to the top of Jintha'Alor in the heart of Vilebranch territory, gain the key to Sharpbeak's cage from the vile Priestess Hexx, and then find and save Sharpbeak!"},
    [9658]={name="Boots of the Maharishi",quality=2,ilvl=43,reqLevel=38,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Gordunni Cobalt'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Orwin Gizzmick in Feralas. Objective: Orwin Gizzmick in Camp Mojache wants 12 samples of Gordunni Cobalt.",zone="Feralas",questName="Gordunni Cobalt",lore="I just arrived here in Feralas, and I've heard that the Gordunni Ogres that inhabit the wilds here have some interesting minerals. Who knows what they are up to, but they sure are protective of that stuff!"},
    [9660]={name="Stargazer Cloak",quality=2,ilvl=43,reqLevel=38,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Gordunni Cobalt'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Orwin Gizzmick in Feralas. Objective: Orwin Gizzmick in Camp Mojache wants 12 samples of Gordunni Cobalt.",zone="Feralas",questName="Gordunni Cobalt",lore="I just arrived here in Feralas, and I've heard that the Gordunni Ogres that inhabit the wilds here have some interesting minerals. Who knows what they are up to, but they sure are protective of that stuff!"},
    [9661]={name="Earthclasp Barrier",quality=2,ilvl=43,reqLevel=39,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Battle Plans'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Feralas. Objective: Bring the Woodpaw Battle Plans to Hadoken Swiftstrider in Camp Mojache.",zone="Feralas",questName="The Battle Plans",lore="With the battle plans of the gnolls discovered, all that now remains is to bring the plans back to Hadoken Swiftstrider in Camp Mojache. Perhaps he or someone there can make further sense of what the gnolls are up to."},
    [9663]={name="Dawnrider's Chestpiece",quality=2,ilvl=45,reqLevel=40,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Delivering the Relic'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Latronicus Moonspear in Feralas. Objective: Deliver the Mysterious Relic to Vestia Moonspear in Feathermoon Stronghold.",zone="Feralas",questName="Delivering the Relic",lore="If you would be so kind as to deliver the relic to my wife Vestia, I would appreciate it. She's not only a fine priestess for our community, but she is one of the most well-versed scholars you'll find anywhere."},
    [9665]={name="Wingcrest Gloves",quality=2,ilvl=50,reqLevel=45,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Dark Heart'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Talo Thornhoof in Feralas. Objective: Talo Thornhoof in Camp Mojache wants Edana Hatetalon's Dark Heart.",zone="Feralas",questName="Dark Heart",lore="Edana Hatetalon is the queen of the Northspring harpies that reside in the ruins to the west. She is pure evil; I have heard that her heart is one of crystal."},
    [9666]={name="Stronghorn Girdle",quality=2,ilvl=50,reqLevel=45,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Dark Heart'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Talo Thornhoof in Feralas. Objective: Talo Thornhoof in Camp Mojache wants Edana Hatetalon's Dark Heart.",zone="Feralas",questName="Dark Heart",lore="Edana Hatetalon is the queen of the Northspring harpies that reside in the ruins to the west. She is pure evil; I have heard that her heart is one of crystal."},
    [9678]={name="Tok'kar's Murloc Basher",quality=2,ilvl=43,reqLevel=35,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Threat From the Sea'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Katar in Swamp of Sorrows. Objective: Kill 10 Marsh Murlocs, 10 Marsh Inkspewer, and 10 Marsh Flesheater, then return to Katar in the Swamp of Sorrows.",zone="Swamp of Sorrows",questName="Threat From the Sea",lore="Before you take rest, speak to Tok'Kar again. While you were gone I believe he finished a few weapons. For your help here, he would offer one of them to you."},
    [9679]={name="Tok'kar's Murloc Chopper",quality=2,ilvl=43,reqLevel=35,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Threat From the Sea'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Katar in Swamp of Sorrows. Objective: Kill 10 Marsh Murlocs, 10 Marsh Inkspewer, and 10 Marsh Flesheater, then return to Katar in the Swamp of Sorrows.",zone="Swamp of Sorrows",questName="Threat From the Sea",lore="Before you take rest, speak to Tok'Kar again. While you were gone I believe he finished a few weapons. For your help here, he would offer one of them to you."},
    [9680]={name="Tok'kar's Murloc Shanker",quality=2,ilvl=43,reqLevel=35,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Threat From the Sea'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Katar in Swamp of Sorrows. Objective: Kill 10 Marsh Murlocs, 10 Marsh Inkspewer, and 10 Marsh Flesheater, then return to Katar in the Swamp of Sorrows.",zone="Swamp of Sorrows",questName="Threat From the Sea",lore="Before you take rest, speak to Tok'Kar again. While you were gone I believe he finished a few weapons. For your help here, he would offer one of them to you."},
    [9682]={name="Leather Chef's Belt",quality=2,ilvl=44,reqLevel=35,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Fresh Meat'. Starts with Dar in Swamp of Sorrows. Objective: Bring 10 Monstrous Crawler Legs to Dar in the Swamp of Sorrows.",zone="Swamp of Sorrows",questName="Fresh Meat",lore="There's a high demand for the succulent taste of crawler meat among my customers; especially the meat from the monstrous crawlers."},
    [9683]={name="Strength of the Treant",quality=2,ilvl=51,reqLevel=40,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Weapons of Spirit'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Witch Doctor Uzer'i in Feralas. Objective: Witch Doctor Uzer'i wants you to wait for a moment while he prepares the weapons.",zone="Feralas",questName="Weapons of Spirit",lore="Imbuing the muisek into the weapons is a difficult process. Now that I have all of the required materials and the muisek of the creatures that you captured, I may begin."},
    [9684]={name="Force of the Hippogryph",quality=2,ilvl=51,reqLevel=40,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Weapons of Spirit'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Witch Doctor Uzer'i in Feralas. Objective: Witch Doctor Uzer'i wants you to wait for a moment while he prepares the weapons.",zone="Feralas",questName="Weapons of Spirit",lore="Imbuing the muisek into the weapons is a difficult process. Now that I have all of the required materials and the muisek of the creatures that you captured, I may begin."},
    [9686]={name="Spirit of the Faerie Dragon",quality=2,ilvl=51,reqLevel=40,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Weapons of Spirit'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Witch Doctor Uzer'i in Feralas. Objective: Witch Doctor Uzer'i wants you to wait for a moment while he prepares the weapons.",zone="Feralas",questName="Weapons of Spirit",lore="Imbuing the muisek into the weapons is a difficult process. Now that I have all of the required materials and the muisek of the creatures that you captured, I may begin."},
    [9687]={name="Grappler's Belt",quality=2,ilvl=33,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Return to Vahlarriel'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Desolace",questName="Return to Vahlarriel",lore="So, the time is now then? I appreciate your efforts, and if the situation does not lend itself, then allow me to thank you now for everything you've done for me and my family."},
    [9698]={name="Gloves of Insight",quality=2,ilvl=33,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Return to Vahlarriel'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Desolace",questName="Return to Vahlarriel",lore="So, the time is now then? I appreciate your efforts, and if the situation does not lend itself, then allow me to thank you now for everything you've done for me and my family."},
    [9699]={name="Garrison Cloak",quality=2,ilvl=33,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Return to Vahlarriel'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Desolace",questName="Return to Vahlarriel",lore="So, the time is now then? I appreciate your efforts, and if the situation does not lend itself, then allow me to thank you now for everything you've done for me and my family."},
    [9704]={name="Rustler Gloves",quality=2,ilvl=43,reqLevel=38,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Identifying the Brood'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Dustwallow Marsh",questName="Identifying the Brood",lore="Whilst that craven fool, Mok'Morokk, wallows in power and Tharg wrestles the demons of sorrow and vengeance and vies for leadership of the clan, I seem to be the only one concerned with identifying the source of aggression on our old home."},
    [9706]={name="Tharg's Disk",quality=2,ilvl=43,reqLevel=38,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Army of the Black Dragon'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Tharg in Dustwallow Marsh. Objective: Tharg in Brackenwall Village wants you to kill 15 Firemane Scouts, 10 Firemane Ash Tails, and 5 Firemane Guards.",zone="Dustwallow Marsh",questName="Army of the Black Dragon",lore="Black dragons kill many ogre. Kill Tharg's wife."},
