    [10461]={name="Shadowy Bracers",quality=2,ilvl=45,reqLevel=40,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Shadoweaver'. Starts with Nilith Lokrav in Searing Gorge. Objective: Kill the group of Shadow Silk Poachers that wander the Searing Gorge. Nilith has reason to believe that there are five of them that need to be exterminated. Return to Nilith in the Searing Gorge when this task is complete.",zone="Searing Gorge",questName="Shadoweaver",lore="The spiders of the Searing Gorge are an invaluable source of shadow silk. As you know, shadow silk is highly sought after by the artisans of our trade."},
    [10462]={name="Shadowy Belt",quality=2,ilvl=47,reqLevel=40,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Undermarket'. Starts with Nilith Lokrav in Searing Gorge. Objective: Slay Trade Master Kovic and his minion Clunk. Retrieve the Trader's Satchel from his corpse and return it to Nilith.",zone="Searing Gorge",questName="The Undermarket",lore="They call themselves the Undermarket: Cutthroat traders that will sell, move, trade and do just about anything for the right price. It gets worse."},
    [10502]={name="Spellpower Goggles Xtreme",quality=2,ilvl=43,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Engineering (requires skill 1).",profession="Engineering"},
    [10504]={name="Green Lens",quality=3,ilvl=49,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Engineering (requires skill 1).",profession="Engineering"},
    [10542]={name="Goblin Mining Helmet",quality=2,ilvl=41,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Engineering (requires skill 1).",profession="Engineering"},
    [10549]={name="Rancher's Trousers",quality=2,ilvl=12,reqLevel=6,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Protecting the Herd'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Rudra Amberstill in Dun Morogh. Objective: Rudra Amberstill wants you to slay Vagash and bring his fang to her at the Ram ranch.",zone="Dun Morogh",questName="Protecting the Herd",lore="We heard the cries in the middle of the night. Then this morning, sure enough, the herd was missing two rams. That dastardly beast known as Vagash has been preying on our livelihood."},
    [10587]={name="Goblin Bomb Dispenser",quality=1,ilvl=46,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Engineering (requires skill 1).",profession="Engineering",proc="Use: Creates a mobile bomb that charges the nearest enemy and explodes for 315 to 385 fire damage. (30 Min Cooldown)"},
    [10637]={name="Brewer's Gloves",quality=2,ilvl=15,reqLevel=10,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Sample for Helbrim'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Apothecary Zinge in The Barrens. Objective: Bring the Wolf Heart Sample to Apothecary Helbrim in the Barrens.",zone="Undercity",questName="Sample for Helbrim",lore="A colleague in Kalimdor, Apothecary Helbrim, is researching the effects of Lordaeron toxins on the beasts of Kalimdor. He would be very interested in a sample of the wolf hearts Renferrel sent me."},
    [10638]={name="Long Draping Cape",quality=2,ilvl=15,reqLevel=10,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Sample for Helbrim'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Apothecary Zinge in The Barrens. Objective: Bring the Wolf Heart Sample to Apothecary Helbrim in the Barrens.",zone="Undercity",questName="Sample for Helbrim",lore="A colleague in Kalimdor, Apothecary Helbrim, is researching the effects of Lordaeron toxins on the beasts of Kalimdor. He would be very interested in a sample of the wolf hearts Renferrel sent me."},
    [10652]={name="Will of the Mountain Giant",quality=2,ilvl=51,reqLevel=40,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Weapons of Spirit'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Witch Doctor Uzer'i in Feralas. Objective: Witch Doctor Uzer'i wants you to wait for a moment while he prepares the weapons.",zone="Feralas",questName="Weapons of Spirit",lore="Imbuing the muisek into the weapons is a difficult process. Now that I have all of the required materials and the muisek of the creatures that you captured, I may begin."},
    [10653]={name="Trailblazer Boots",quality=2,ilvl=30,reqLevel=15,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Horde Presence'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Kadrak in Stonetalon Mountains. Objective: Kill the leader of the Talon Den, Rynthariel the Keymaster.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Horde Presence",lore="This scroll is from that scheming dryad Rynthariel, Keymaster of the Talon Den on Stonetalon Peak. She'll not be making any more contact with the messenger you looted this from, heh, but we must stand our ground here."},
    [10654]={name="Jutebraid Gloves",quality=2,ilvl=31,reqLevel=15,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Horde Presence'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Kadrak in Stonetalon Mountains. Objective: Kill the leader of the Talon Den, Rynthariel the Keymaster.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Horde Presence",lore="This scroll is from that scheming dryad Rynthariel, Keymaster of the Talon Den on Stonetalon Peak. She'll not be making any more contact with the messenger you looted this from, heh, but we must stand our ground here."},
    [10657]={name="Talbar Mantle",quality=2,ilvl=26,reqLevel=10,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'In Nightmares'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="The Barrens",questName="In Nightmares",lore="This shard holds great secrets; it is the pure essence of the Emerald Dream. However, what I see in this shard is not a dream; one would call this sort of a vision a nightmare."},
    [10658]={name="Quagmire Galoshes",quality=2,ilvl=25,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'In Nightmares'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="The Barrens",questName="In Nightmares",lore="This shard holds great secrets; it is the pure essence of the Emerald Dream. However, what I see in this shard is not a dream; one would call this sort of a vision a nightmare."},
    [10659]={name="Shard of the Splithooves",quality=2,ilvl=57,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Heroes of Old'. Starts with Corporal Thund Splithoof in Swamp of Sorrows. Objective: Open the chest and claim your reward.",zone="Blasted Lands",questName="Heroes of Old",lore="Please, take from this a relic of old. We no longer have a use for the item. May it serve you well in your fight against the legion."},
    [10686]={name="Aegis of Battle",quality=2,ilvl=55,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Venom to the Undercity'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Apothecary Lydon. Objective: Bring Faranell's Parcel to Master Apothecary Faranell in the Undercity.",zone="The Hinterlands",questName="Venom to the Undercity",lore="The venom you gathered from the Witherbark's spider god is quite a find! I've been able to kill nearly two dozen rabbits with just a drop of the stuff."},
    [10697]={name="Enchanted Azsharite Felbane Dagger",quality=2,ilvl=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Enchanted Azsharite Fel Weaponry'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Galvan the Ancient in Stranglethorn Vale. Objective: Wait for Galvan to finish forging the weaponry.",zone="Stranglethorn Vale",questName="Enchanted Azsharite Fel Weaponry",lore="the creation of each weapon will take some time. Additionally, you may only use the power of the Felcurse once per three minutes. Its weakening properties against Razelikh the Defiler and his minions may be variable in duration.",proc="Use: Weakens the servants of Razelikh the Defiler. Must be within close proximity of the target to activate."},
    [10698]={name="Enchanted Azsharite Felbane Staff",quality=2,ilvl=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Enchanted Azsharite Fel Weaponry'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Galvan the Ancient in Stranglethorn Vale. Objective: Wait for Galvan to finish forging the weaponry.",zone="Stranglethorn Vale",questName="Enchanted Azsharite Fel Weaponry",lore="the creation of each weapon will take some time. Additionally, you may only use the power of the Felcurse once per three minutes. Its weakening properties against Razelikh the Defiler and his minions may be variable in duration.",proc="Use: Weakens the servants of Razelikh the Defiler. Must be within close proximity of the target to activate."},
    [10700]={name="Encarmine Boots",quality=2,ilvl=45,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Brood of Onyxia'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Draz'Zilb in Dustwallow Marsh. Objective: Speak with Overlord Mok'Morokk in Brackenwall Village.",zone="Dustwallow Marsh",questName="The Brood of Onyxia",lore="Onyxia's brood has been scattered across the Dragonmurk. It is imperative that no more whelps be permitted to hatch. Make haste to Wyrmbog in the south of Dustwallow Marsh."},
    [10701]={name="Boots of Zua'tec",quality=2,ilvl=45,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Brood of Onyxia'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Draz'Zilb in Dustwallow Marsh. Objective: Speak with Overlord Mok'Morokk in Brackenwall Village.",zone="Dustwallow Marsh",questName="The Brood of Onyxia",lore="Onyxia's brood has been scattered across the Dragonmurk. It is imperative that no more whelps be permitted to hatch. Make haste to Wyrmbog in the south of Dustwallow Marsh."},
    [10702]={name="Enormous Ogre Boots",quality=2,ilvl=43,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Overlord Mok'Morokk's Concern'. The quest is in Dustwallow Marsh. Objective: Overlord Mok'Morokk in Brackenwall Village wants you to retrieve his grog, snuff and strongbox in Dustwallow Swamp.",zone="Dustwallow Marsh",questName="Overlord Mok'Morokk's Concern",lore="Big dragons come and make fire at old home. Me smart ogre."},
    [10705]={name="Firwillow Wristbands",quality=2,ilvl=47,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Doling Justice'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Jer'kai Moonweaver in Darnassus. Objective: Take Jer'kai's Signet Ring to High Priestess Tyrande Whisperwind in Darnassus.",zone="Feralas",questName="Doling Justice",lore="Out here in the wilderness, Kindal and I have meager means to reward your help, but we don't want you to feel unappreciated. Take my signet ring."},
    [10706]={name="Nightscale Girdle",quality=2,ilvl=47,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Doling Justice'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Jer'kai Moonweaver in Darnassus. Objective: Take Jer'kai's Signet Ring to High Priestess Tyrande Whisperwind in Darnassus.",zone="Feralas",questName="Doling Justice",lore="Out here in the wilderness, Kindal and I have meager means to reward your help, but we don't want you to feel unappreciated. Take my signet ring."},
    [10727]={name="Goblin Dragon Gun",quality=1,ilvl=48,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Engineering (requires skill 1).",profession="Engineering",proc="Use: Deals 61 to 69 fire damage for 10 sec to all targets in a cone in front of the engineer using the weapon. Â  That is unless it explodes..... (5 Min Cooldown)"},
    [10739]={name="Ring of Fortitude",quality=2,ilvl=53,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Rise, Obsidion!'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Dying Archaeologist in Searing Gorge. Objective: Slay Lathoric the Black and Obsidion, and return to Thorius in Ironforge with the Head of Lathoric the Black and the Heart of Obsidion.",zone="Searing Gorge",questName="Rise, Obsidion!",lore="It... It... It was all a trap. Forgive... me. Kill the bastard... Kill him for us... for Thorius."},
    [10743]={name="Drakefire Headguard",quality=2,ilvl=51,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Set Them Ablaze!'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Squire Maltrake in Searing Gorge. Objective: Set the North, South, East, and West Sentry Towers on fire by using the Torch of Retribution inside each of the buildings.",zone="Searing Gorge",questName="Set Them Ablaze!",lore="Listen well. While the four towers can never be destroyed, you can use the torch of retribution to set them ablaze for a very long period of time: A fire that no element or force can subdue."},
    [10744]={name="Axe of the Ebon Drake",quality=2,ilvl=51,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Set Them Ablaze!'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Squire Maltrake in Searing Gorge. Objective: Set the North, South, East, and West Sentry Towers on fire by using the Torch of Retribution inside each of the buildings.",zone="Searing Gorge",questName="Set Them Ablaze!",lore="Listen well. While the four towers can never be destroyed, you can use the torch of retribution to set them ablaze for a very long period of time: A fire that no element or force can subdue."},
    [10747]={name="Teacher's Sash",quality=2,ilvl=41,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Mazen's Behest'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Mazen Mac'Nadir in Stormwind City. Objective: Speak with Acolyte Dellis in Stormwind.",zone="Stormwind City",questName="Mazen's Behest",lore="Master Mazen's directions were quite clear: Deliver a very important essay to Watcher Mahar Ba in Nethergarde Keep. But I had never been to the Blasted Lands before!"},
    [10748]={name="Wanderlust Boots",quality=2,ilvl=41,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Mazen's Behest'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Mazen Mac'Nadir in Stormwind City. Objective: Speak with Acolyte Dellis in Stormwind.",zone="Stormwind City",questName="Mazen's Behest",lore="Master Mazen's directions were quite clear: Deliver a very important essay to Watcher Mahar Ba in Nethergarde Keep. But I had never been to the Blasted Lands before!"},
    [10750]={name="Lifeforce Dirk",quality=3,ilvl=54,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The God Hakkar'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Yeh'kinya in Tanaris. Objective: Bring the Filled Egg of Hakkar to Yeh'kinya in Tanaris.",zone="Sunken Temple",questName="The God Hakkar",lore="Now it is time to capture the essence of the avatar of Hakkar. Take the Egg of Hakkar to the Sanctum of the Fallen God in the Sunken Temple in Azeroth."},
