    [11841]={name="Senior Designer's Pantaloons",quality=3,ilvl=55,reqLevel=50,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Fineous Darkvire.",zone="Blackrock Depths",npc="Fineous Darkvire"},
    [11853]={name="Rambling Boots",quality=2,ilvl=18,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Stolen Silver'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Gazrog in The Barrens. Objective: Bring the Stolen Silver to Gazrog in the Crossroads.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Stolen Silver",lore="You may have killed the raptors, but the silver they stole must be recovered! I have reports that the raptors have a large grouping of nests south of Ratchet, known as the Raptor Grounds."},
    [11856]={name="Ceremonial Elven Blade",quality=2,ilvl=45,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'A Hero's Welcome'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Ginro Hearthkindle in Feralas. Objective: Speak with Shandris Feathermoon in Feathermoon Stronghold.",zone="Feralas",questName="A Hero's Welcome",lore="General Shandris Feathermoon would like to speak with you personally."},
    [11857]={name="Sanctimonial Rod",quality=2,ilvl=46,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'A Hero's Welcome'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Ginro Hearthkindle in Feralas. Objective: Speak with Shandris Feathermoon in Feathermoon Stronghold.",zone="Feralas",questName="A Hero's Welcome",lore="General Shandris Feathermoon would like to speak with you personally."},
    [11858]={name="Battlehard Cape",quality=2,ilvl=45,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'A Grim Discovery'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Krueg Skullsplitter in Orgrimmar. Objective: Bring the Crate of Grimtotem Horns to Belgrom Rockmaul in Orgrimmar.",zone="Feralas",questName="A Grim Discovery",lore="What?! Ah, so I did mention a bounty, didn't I? Well, that'll teach me to open my mouth, won't it? You did the work, so I suppose it is only right you reap the greatest reward from it."},
    [11865]={name="Rancor Boots",quality=2,ilvl=53,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Ribbly Screwspigot'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Yuka Screwspigot in Burning Steppes. Objective: Bring Ribbly's Head to Yuka Screwspigot in the Burning Steppes.",zone="Blackrock Depths",questName="Ribbly Screwspigot",lore="My brother Ribbly has always been a drain to his family, taking our money and wasting it on one scheme after another."},
    [11867]={name="Maddening Gauntlets",quality=2,ilvl=53,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Ogre Head On A Stick = Party'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Oralius in Burning Steppes. Objective: Take Gor'tesh's Lopped Off Head and place it at the top of Dreadmaul Rock. Look for a soft dirt mound to plant the pike.",zone="Burning Steppes",questName="Ogre Head On A Stick = Party",lore="Just one last thing you must do, soldier. I've taken the liberty of putting Gor'tesh's head on a pike. Now all you have to do is take this head to the top of Dreadmaul Rock and stick it into the ground."},
    [11869]={name="Sha'ni's Ring",quality=2,ilvl=53,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Krom'Grul'. Starts with Sha'ni Proudtusk in Burning Steppes. Objective: Recover Sha'ni's Nose-Ring from Krom'Grul and return it to Thal'trak in Kargath. Search the various caves and mines in Dreadmaul Rock.",zone="Burning Steppes",questName="Krom'Grul",lore="My physical being ceased functioning after an hour of this torture. The beast then ripped my wedding nose-ring off of my face and stuck it on his finger."},
    [11873]={name="Ethereal Mist Cape",quality=2,ilvl=56,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Ancient Spirit'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Arei in Ashenvale. Objective: Escort Arei to safety, then speak with Kayneth Stillwind in Forest Song, in eastern Ashenvale.",zone="Felwood",questName="Ancient Spirit",lore="Felwood was once a peaceful and serene land... Until the legion took hold. The infernals, destruction, chaos... The skull of Gul'dan ensured that none were spared here."},
    [11874]={name="Clouddrift Mantle",quality=2,ilvl=56,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Ancient Spirit'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Arei in Ashenvale. Objective: Escort Arei to safety, then speak with Kayneth Stillwind in Forest Song, in eastern Ashenvale.",zone="Felwood",questName="Ancient Spirit",lore="Felwood was once a peaceful and serene land... Until the legion took hold. The infernals, destruction, chaos... The skull of Gul'dan ensured that none were spared here."},
    [11875]={name="Breezecloud Bracers",quality=2,ilvl=54,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Further Corruption'. Starts with Eridan Bluewind in Felwood. Objective: Eridan Bluewind in Felwood wants you to kill 8 Jadefire Hellcallers, 8 Jadefire Betrayers, 8 Jadefire Tricksters, and Xavaric. Return to Eridan when the task is completed.",zone="Felwood",questName="Further Corruption",lore="A second encampment of satyrs threatens the land of Felwood towards the north, led by the cruel Xavaric. The vile betrayers and tricksters feed upon the corruption of the native creatures of Felwood."},
    [11876]={name="Plainstalker Tunic",quality=2,ilvl=56,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Bait for Lar'korwi'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Torwa Pathfinder in Un'Goro Crater. Objective: Using the contents of Torwa's Pouch, summon Lar'korwi and defeat him. Then bring Lar'korwi's Head to Torwa Pathfinder near the entrance to Un'Goro Crater.",zone="Un'Goro Crater",questName="The Bait for Lar'korwi",lore="This will be the most difficult part because there is some complexity to the plan. To the north of here, you will find a small trail into the mountains."},
    [11882]={name="Outrider Leggings",quality=2,ilvl=56,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Bait for Lar'korwi'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Torwa Pathfinder in Un'Goro Crater. Objective: Using the contents of Torwa's Pouch, summon Lar'korwi and defeat him. Then bring Lar'korwi's Head to Torwa Pathfinder near the entrance to Un'Goro Crater.",zone="Un'Goro Crater",questName="The Bait for Lar'korwi",lore="This will be the most difficult part because there is some complexity to the plan. To the north of here, you will find a small trail into the mountains."},
    [11884]={name="Moonlit Amice",quality=2,ilvl=33,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Return to Vahlarriel'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Desolace",questName="Return to Vahlarriel",lore="So, the time is now then? I appreciate your efforts, and if the situation does not lend itself, then allow me to thank you now for everything you've done for me and my family."},
    [11888]={name="Quintis' Research Gloves",quality=2,ilvl=50,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Mystery of Morrowgrain'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Quintis Jonespyre in Feralas. Objective: Bring 10 Morrowgrain to Quintis Jonespyre in Feathermoon Stronghold.",zone="Feathermoon Stronghold",questName="The Mystery of Morrowgrain",lore="Let me to be frank with you. I'm interested - nay, concerned with why the Arch Druid in Darnassus is using the name of the Cenarion Circle as well as the Circle's resources to procure vast amounts of morrowgrain."},
    [11904]={name="Spirit of Aquementas",quality=2,ilvl=56,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'It's Dangerous to Go Alone'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Linken in Un'Goro Crater. Objective: Travel to Fire Plume Ridge, south of Marshal's Refuge.Find Blazerunner and use the totem to remove his protective aura. Once he has been defeated, acquire the Golden Flame from the cave.",zone="Un'Goro Crater",questName="It's Dangerous to Go Alone",lore="I finally remember now... I did come here to fight Blazerunner. I was on a journey, and this was to be the last step. But I am no longer the hero..."},
    [11905]={name="Linken's Boomerang",quality=2,ilvl=56,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'It's Dangerous to Go Alone'. Starts with Linken in Un'Goro Crater. Objective: Travel to Fire Plume Ridge, south of Marshal's Refuge.Find Blazerunner and use the totem to remove his protective aura. Once he has been defeated, acquire the Golden Flame from the cave.",zone="Un'Goro Crater",questName="It's Dangerous to Go Alone",lore="I finally remember now... I did come here to fight Blazerunner. I was on a journey, and this was to be the last step. But I am no longer the hero...",proc="Use: Flings a magical boomerang towards target enemy dealing 113 to 187 damage and has a chance to stun or disarm them. (3 Min Cooldown)"},
    [11908]={name="Archaeologist's Quarry Boots",quality=2,ilvl=55,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Roll the Bones'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Spark Nilminer in Un'Goro Crater. Objective: Bring 8 Dinosaur Bones to Spark Nilminer in Un'Goro Crater.",zone="Un'Goro Crater",questName="Roll the Bones",lore="You'd think that being chief digger for Marshal Expeditions means I like digging. There might be worse things to do in this world... but none really leap to mind."},
    [11909]={name="Excavator's Utility Belt",quality=2,ilvl=55,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Roll the Bones'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Spark Nilminer in Un'Goro Crater. Objective: Bring 8 Dinosaur Bones to Spark Nilminer in Un'Goro Crater.",zone="Un'Goro Crater",questName="Roll the Bones",lore="You'd think that being chief digger for Marshal Expeditions means I like digging. There might be worse things to do in this world... but none really leap to mind."},
    [11911]={name="Treetop Leggings",quality=2,ilvl=55,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'A Little Help From My Friends'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Ringo in Un'Goro Crater. Objective: Lead Ringo to Spraggle Frock at Marshal's Refuge.If Ringo faints, use Spraggle's Canteen to revive him.",zone="Un'Goro Crater",questName="A Little Help From My Friends",lore="Ugh... It's so hot... I was exploring this area, when all of a sudden, the heat just became unbearable. I must be suffering from heat exhaustion."},
    [11913]={name="Clayridge Helm",quality=2,ilvl=55,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'A Little Help From My Friends'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Ringo in Un'Goro Crater. Objective: Lead Ringo to Spraggle Frock at Marshal's Refuge.If Ringo faints, use Spraggle's Canteen to revive him.",zone="Un'Goro Crater",questName="A Little Help From My Friends",lore="Ugh... It's so hot... I was exploring this area, when all of a sudden, the heat just became unbearable. I must be suffering from heat exhaustion."},
    [11915]={name="Shizzle's Drizzle Blocker",quality=2,ilvl=55,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Shizzle's Flyer'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Un'Goro Crater. Objective: Collect 8 Webbed Diemetradon Scales and 8 Webbed Pterrordax Scales for Shizzle in Marshal's Refuge.",zone="Un'Goro Crater",questName="Shizzle's Flyer",lore="I'm making a flying machine! I got stranded here, and I'm absolutely horrible at finding my way around. I'd take a gryphon or wind rider back to Gadgetzan, but those beasts just scare me to death."},
    [11917]={name="Shizzle's Nozzle Wiper",quality=2,ilvl=55,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Shizzle's Flyer'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Un'Goro Crater. Objective: Collect 8 Webbed Diemetradon Scales and 8 Webbed Pterrordax Scales for Shizzle in Marshal's Refuge.",zone="Un'Goro Crater",questName="Shizzle's Flyer",lore="I'm making a flying machine! I got stranded here, and I'm absolutely horrible at finding my way around. I'd take a gryphon or wind rider back to Gadgetzan, but those beasts just scare me to death."},
    [11918]={name="Grotslab Gloves",quality=2,ilvl=55,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Beware of Pterrordax'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Un'Goro Crater. Objective: Kill 10 Pterrordax and 15 Frenzied Pterrordax, then speak to Spraggle Frock at Marshal's Refuge.",zone="Un'Goro Crater",questName="Beware of Pterrordax",lore="Wanted: A skilled fighter to deal with the threat of the Pterrordax that inhabit the Un'Goro Crater. Their numbers are growing, and they are becoming a menace to travelers in the area."},
    [11936]={name="Relic Hunter Belt",quality=2,ilvl=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Absent Minded Prospector'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Darkshore",questName="The Absent Minded Prospector",lore="So the prospector wants to send the mysterious fossil to the Explorers' League in Darnassus? I don't feel right leaving Darkshore without him."},
    [11945]={name="Dark Iron Ring",quality=2,ilvl=53,reqLevel=48,sourceType="object_drop",instructions="Found in a container.",npc="a container"},
    [11946]={name="Fire Opal Necklace",quality=2,ilvl=52,reqLevel=47,sourceType="object_drop",instructions="Found in a container.",npc="a container"},
    [11964]={name="Swiftstrike Cudgel",quality=3,ilvl=55,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Hurley Blackbreath'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Ragnar Thunderbrew in Dun Morogh. Objective: Bring the Lost Thunderbrew Recipe to Ragnar Thunderbrew in Kharanos.",zone="Blackrock Depths",questName="Hurley Blackbreath",lore="The Dark Iron dwarves, led by the villain Hurley Blackbreath, stole one of the Thunderbrew's best recipes, Thunderbrew Lager. The villains! They don't deserve such a fine brew!, I have a tough task for you."},
