    [15449]={name="Ghastly Trousers",quality=3,ilvl=18,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Power to Destroy...'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Varimathras in Undercity. Objective: Bring the books Spells of Shadow and Incantations from the Nether to Varimathras in Undercity.",zone="Ragefire Chasm",questName="The Power to Destroy...",lore="Many denizens of the Legion bestow gifts on their followers as you may well know. Some of these gifts the Dark Lady feels would be better off in her hands than in the hands of those with..."},
    [15450]={name="Dredgemire Leggings",quality=3,ilvl=18,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Power to Destroy...'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Varimathras in Undercity. Objective: Bring the books Spells of Shadow and Incantations from the Nether to Varimathras in Undercity.",zone="Ragefire Chasm",questName="The Power to Destroy...",lore="Many denizens of the Legion bestow gifts on their followers as you may well know. Some of these gifts the Dark Lady feels would be better off in her hands than in the hands of those with..."},
    [15452]={name="Featherbead Bracers",quality=2,ilvl=18,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Returning the Lost Satchel'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Maur Grimtotem in Thunder Bluff. Objective: Take the Grimtotem Satchel to Rahauro in Thunder Bluff.",zone="Ragefire Chasm",questName="Returning the Lost Satchel",lore="You find a satchel under the body of the tauren. It is still gripped tightly in his arms as though he was trying to protect it while being attacked by the troggs."},
    [15453]={name="Savannah Bracers",quality=2,ilvl=18,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Returning the Lost Satchel'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Maur Grimtotem in Thunder Bluff. Objective: Take the Grimtotem Satchel to Rahauro in Thunder Bluff.",zone="Ragefire Chasm",questName="Returning the Lost Satchel",lore="You find a satchel under the body of the tauren. It is still gripped tightly in his arms as though he was trying to protect it while being attacked by the troggs."},
    [15455]={name="Dustfall Robes",quality=2,ilvl=37,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Hints of a New Plague?'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Quae in Hillsbrad Foothills. Objective: Find Phin Odelic in Southshore.",zone="Hillsbrad Foothills",questName="Hints of a New Plague?",lore="I've seen Kinelory look way worse after a night in the tavern than she does now. You obviously did a good job protecting her."},
    [15456]={name="Lightstep Leggings",quality=2,ilvl=37,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Hints of a New Plague?'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Quae in Hillsbrad Foothills. Objective: Find Phin Odelic in Southshore.",zone="Hillsbrad Foothills",questName="Hints of a New Plague?",lore="I've seen Kinelory look way worse after a night in the tavern than she does now. You obviously did a good job protecting her."},
    [15457]={name="Desert Shoulders",quality=2,ilvl=28,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Grimtotem Spying'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Cliffwatcher Longhorn in Thousand Needles. Objective: Locate and retrieve the three Secret Notes in Darkcloud Pinnacle.",zone="Thousand Needles",questName="Grimtotem Spying",lore="you have served us well in the past, so I now entrust to you an important mission. The Grimtotem Clan is up to something secretive. Three agents of unknown origin were seen visiting the Grimtotem over the recent weeks."},
    [15458]={name="Tundra Boots",quality=2,ilvl=28,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Grimtotem Spying'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Cliffwatcher Longhorn in Thousand Needles. Objective: Locate and retrieve the three Secret Notes in Darkcloud Pinnacle.",zone="Thousand Needles",questName="Grimtotem Spying",lore="you have served us well in the past, so I now entrust to you an important mission. The Grimtotem Clan is up to something secretive. Three agents of unknown origin were seen visiting the Grimtotem over the recent weeks."},
    [15461]={name="Lightheel Boots",quality=2,ilvl=25,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Protect Kanati Greycloud'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Thousand Needles. Objective: Protect Kanati Greycloud from the centaur attack.",zone="Thousand Needles",questName="Protect Kanati Greycloud",lore="But, there may be more centaur than I thought, I ask you, to fight with me against these vile assassins."},
    [15462]={name="Loamflake Bracers",quality=2,ilvl=25,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Protect Kanati Greycloud'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Thousand Needles. Objective: Protect Kanati Greycloud from the centaur attack.",zone="Thousand Needles",questName="Protect Kanati Greycloud",lore="But, there may be more centaur than I thought, I ask you, to fight with me against these vile assassins."},
    [15466]={name="Clink Shield",quality=2,ilvl=28,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Arikara'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Magatha Grimtotem in Thousand Needles. Objective: Slay Arikara. Bring her remains and the Incendia powder to Motega Firemane in Whitereach Post as proof of your deed.",zone="Thousand Needles",questName="Arikara",lore="Take this refined and purified Incendia powder to Thousand Needles and toss it on the sacred fire of life. It is located in the Darkcloud Pinnacle on an isolated needle where they bury their dead."},
    [15467]={name="Inventor's League Ring",quality=2,ilvl=31,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Hypercapacitor Gizmo'. Starts with Wizlo Bearingshiner in Thousand Needles. Objective: Slay the beast and bring back the Hypercapacitor Gizmo and Panther Cage Key to Wizlo Bearingshiner.",zone="Thousand Needles",questName="Hypercapacitor Gizmo",lore="I am the only survivor from our caravan attack by the centaur! A rare yet mighty panther is guarding my best gizmo, which is around his neck."},
    [15468]={name="Windsong Drape",quality=2,ilvl=29,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Free at Last'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Lakota Windsong in Thousand Needles. Objective: Escort Lakota Windsong from the Darkcloud Pinnacle, and then talk to Thalia Amberhide at Freewind Post.",zone="Thousand Needles",questName="Free at Last",lore="Arnak thinks we're going to be married... but after I declined his offer he came back that night and kidnapped me. My brother tried to stop him, but Arnak was too strong."},
    [15469]={name="Windsong Cinch",quality=2,ilvl=29,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Free at Last'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Lakota Windsong in Thousand Needles. Objective: Escort Lakota Windsong from the Darkcloud Pinnacle, and then talk to Thalia Amberhide at Freewind Post.",zone="Thousand Needles",questName="Free at Last",lore="Arnak thinks we're going to be married... but after I declined his offer he came back that night and kidnapped me. My brother tried to stop him, but Arnak was too strong."},
    [15470]={name="Plainsguard Leggings",quality=2,ilvl=29,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Wanted - Arnak Grimtotem'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Thousand Needles. Objective: Slay Arnak Grimtotem and bring proof of your deed to Cliffwatcher Longhorn in Freewind Post.",zone="Thousand Needles",questName="Wanted - Arnak Grimtotem",lore="Wanted: Arnak Grimtotem Arnak the outcast is wanted for the heinous crimes of murder and kidnapping. Handsome rewards will be given to those brave enough to bring this criminal to justice."},
    [15471]={name="Brawnhide Armor",quality=2,ilvl=29,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Wanted - Arnak Grimtotem'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Thousand Needles. Objective: Slay Arnak Grimtotem and bring proof of your deed to Cliffwatcher Longhorn in Freewind Post.",zone="Thousand Needles",questName="Wanted - Arnak Grimtotem",lore="Wanted: Arnak Grimtotem Arnak the outcast is wanted for the heinous crimes of murder and kidnapping. Handsome rewards will be given to those brave enough to bring this criminal to justice."},
