    [15689]={name="Trader's Ring",quality=2,ilvl=35,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Bodyguard for Hire'.",zone="Desolace",questName="Bodyguard for Hire",lore="Under normal circumstances, Rigger and I would lead our kodo past the Kolkar Centaur. Every now and then we hear the Centaur war drums, and when we hear those we stop."},
    [15690]={name="Kodobone Necklace",quality=2,ilvl=41,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Bone Collector'.",zone="Desolace",questName="Bone Collector",lore="We're sitting on a goldmine here, I tell you - a goldmine! Kodo bones will change the world forever... I have customers making furniture, music instruments, and even blasting powder out of them."},
    [15695]={name="Studded Ring Shield",quality=2,ilvl=38,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Gizelton Caravan'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Rigger Gizelton in Desolace. Objective: Escort the Gizelton Caravan through Mannoroc Coven. Talk with Smeed at Scrabblescrew's Camp for your reward.",zone="Desolace",questName="Gizelton Caravan",lore="You look like a capable. Perhaps you're looking to make some money? Cork and I started this caravan to make a bundle of money; little did we know the dangers of turning a buck!"},
    [15697]={name="Kodo Rustler Boots",quality=2,ilvl=38,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Kodo Roundup'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Smeed Scrabblescrew in Desolace. Objective: Bring five Tamed Kodos and the Kodo Kombobulator back to Smeed Scrabblescrew at Scrabblescrew's Camp.",zone="Desolace",questName="Kodo Roundup",lore="Well, the only caravan brave enough to travel these parts relies on me. Ever since I learned how to rejuvenate and control aged and dying kodos with my kodo kombobulator, the caravan owner Cork, Rigger, and I entered a partnership."},
    [15698]={name="Wrangling Spaulders",quality=2,ilvl=38,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Kodo Roundup'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Smeed Scrabblescrew in Desolace. Objective: Bring five Tamed Kodos and the Kodo Kombobulator back to Smeed Scrabblescrew at Scrabblescrew's Camp.",zone="Desolace",questName="Kodo Roundup",lore="Bibbly thinks he is the only goblin in Desolace who knows how to make money. Well, the only caravan brave enough to travel these parts relies on me."},
    [15702]={name="Chemist's Ring",quality=2,ilvl=55,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Melding of Influences'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Chemist Fuely in Undercity. Objective: Bring a Merged Ooze Sample to Chemist Fuely in Undercity.",zone="Undercity",questName="Melding of Influences",lore="Here is some encased ooze created from the Felwood samples you recovered. Take the case to Un'Goro Crater and find a pure ooze... the primal variety will do nicely."},
    [15703]={name="Chemist's Smock",quality=2,ilvl=55,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Melding of Influences'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Chemist Fuely in Undercity. Objective: Bring a Merged Ooze Sample to Chemist Fuely in Undercity.",zone="Undercity",questName="Melding of Influences",lore="Here is some encased ooze created from the Felwood samples you recovered. Take the case to Un'Goro Crater and find a pure ooze... the primal variety will do nicely."},
    [15704]={name="Hunter's Insignia Medal",quality=2,ilvl=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Past Endeavors'. The quest is in Winterspring. Objective: Bring Storm Shadowhoof's Marker to Melor Stonehoof in Thunder Bluff.",zone="Winterspring",questName="Past Endeavors",lore="Before you spoke to me, I had heard of your endeavors... that you had an unyielding desire to prove yourself, that you had an exceptional ability as a, and I now know these things to be the truth."},
    [15707]={name="Brantwood Sash",quality=2,ilvl=58,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'A Final Blow'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Greta Mosshoof in Felwood. Objective: Kill Moora and Salia, and bring Shadow Lord Fel'dan's Head to Greta Mosshoof in Felwood.",zone="Felwood",questName="A Final Blow",lore="Unfortunately, I see the only way to stop this threat to Felwood is a frontal attack. There are no other ways into Shadow Hold, and I have no means to teleport you inside."},
    [15786]={name="Fernpulse Jerkin",quality=2,ilvl=59,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'High Chief Winterfall'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Donova Snowden in Winterspring. Objective: Donova Snowden in Winterspring wants you to defeat High Chief Winterfall.",zone="Winterspring",questName="High Chief Winterfall",lore="While we still know very little about why the furbolg have been ingesting this strange substance, I do think it's best that we put a stop to it before it gets out of hand."},
    [15787]={name="Willow Band Hauberk",quality=2,ilvl=59,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'High Chief Winterfall'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Donova Snowden in Winterspring. Objective: Donova Snowden in Winterspring wants you to defeat High Chief Winterfall.",zone="Winterspring",questName="High Chief Winterfall",lore="While we still know very little about why the furbolg have been ingesting this strange substance, I do think it's best that we put a stop to it before it gets out of hand."},
    [15789]={name="Deep River Cloak",quality=2,ilvl=56,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Strange Sources'. Starts with Donova Snowden in Winterspring. Objective: Follow Donova Snowden's instructions, then report back.",zone="Winterspring",questName="Strange Sources",lore="To tell you the truth, although there are no volcanoes here in Winterspring, I believe that there are far more threatening reasons for these hot springs..."},
    [15791]={name="Turquoise Sash",quality=2,ilvl=58,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Crystal of Zin-Malor'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Wynd Nightchaser in Darnassus. Objective: Deliver the Crystal of Zin-Malor to Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm in Darnassus.",zone="Winterspring",questName="The Crystal of Zin-Malor",lore="Quite impressive. The crystal of Zin-Malor can never be returned to the temple which, as you know, lies in ruin. But I believe that your effort to undo the evil of the past should not go unrewarded."},
    [15792]={name="Plow Wood Spaulders",quality=2,ilvl=58,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Crystal of Zin-Malor'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Wynd Nightchaser in Darnassus. Objective: Deliver the Crystal of Zin-Malor to Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm in Darnassus.",zone="Winterspring",questName="The Crystal of Zin-Malor",lore="Quite impressive. The crystal of Zin-Malor can never be returned to the temple which, as you know, lies in ruin. But I believe that your effort to undo the evil of the past should not go unrewarded."},
    [15796]={name="Seaspray Bracers",quality=2,ilvl=59,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Guarding Secrets'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Trull Failbane in Thunder Bluff. Objective: Take the Blue-feathered Necklace to Nara Wildmane.",zone="Winterspring",questName="Guarding Secrets",lore="While I do possess much knowledge about the owlbeasts you defeated in Winterspring, I am not very learned on the subject of the magics they wield."},
    [15799]={name="Heroic Commendation Medal",quality=2,ilvl=58,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Mission Accomplished!'. Starts with High Executor Derrington in Tirisfal Glades. Objective: &lt;name&gt;, your successful re-engineering of the cauldrons is a tremendous victory for us!Let all within my presence hear: for service to the Forsaken and to the Horde as a whole above and beyond what was expected - in the face of overwhelming odds and incredible danger, might I add - I give &lt;name&gt; this, and I extend upon him our undying gratitude as a true hero of the Horde. &nbsp;Huzzah!",zone="Western Plaguelands",questName="Mission Accomplished!"},
    [15804]={name="Cerise Drape",quality=2,ilvl=56,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Glyphed Oaken Branch'. Starts with Mulgris Deepriver in Darnassus. Objective: Based on the magic enchanted within the Glyphed Oaken Branch, its delivery to the Cenarion Circle in Darnassus is the next step the tauren druid sought. Seek one of the druids there for assistance.",zone="Western Plaguelands",questName="Glyphed Oaken Branch",lore="The lifeless hand of the tauren druid clutches a surprisingly healthy looking oaken branch. Examining the branch reveals glyphs of a druidic nature carved into the bark."},
    [15812]={name="Orchid Amice",quality=2,ilvl=56,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'A Matter of Time'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Chromie in Western Plaguelands. Objective: Use the Temporal Displacer near one of Andorhal's silos and uncover Temporal Parasites.Slay 15 Temporal Parasites, and then return the Temporal Displacer to Chromie in the Andorhal Inn, Western Plaguelands.",zone="Western Plaguelands",questName="A Matter of Time",lore="Tampering of the timeline by a sinister force - most likely the Scourge - has occurred in Andorhal! I can try to keep the passage of time here intact and mend what has been damaged, but I'll need your help to do so uninterrupted."},
    [15813]={name="Gold Link Belt",quality=2,ilvl=56,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'A Matter of Time'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Chromie in Western Plaguelands. Objective: Use the Temporal Displacer near one of Andorhal's silos and uncover Temporal Parasites.Slay 15 Temporal Parasites, and then return the Temporal Displacer to Chromie in the Andorhal Inn, Western Plaguelands.",zone="Western Plaguelands",questName="A Matter of Time",lore="Tampering of the timeline by a sinister force - most likely the Scourge - has occurred in Andorhal! I can try to keep the passage of time here intact and mend what has been damaged, but I'll need your help to do so uninterrupted."},
    [15822]={name="Shadowskin Spaulders",quality=2,ilvl=55,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Runecloth'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Meilosh in Felwood. Objective: Bring 30 Runecloth to Meilosh in Timbermaw Hold.",zone="Timbermaw Hold",questName="Runecloth",lore="In Timbermaw, we are content. We do not like strangers. This is good for us, but it is bad for trade. Not long ago, a rare night elf friend came to Timbermaw and she wore a runecloth cloak."},
    [15823]={name="Bricksteel Gauntlets",quality=2,ilvl=55,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Runecloth'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Meilosh in Felwood. Objective: Bring 30 Runecloth to Meilosh in Timbermaw Hold.",zone="Timbermaw Hold",questName="Runecloth",lore="In Timbermaw, we are content. We do not like strangers. This is good for us, but it is bad for trade. Not long ago, a rare night elf friend came to Timbermaw and she wore a runecloth cloak."},
    [15824]={name="Astoria Robes",quality=2,ilvl=59,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Put Her Down'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Helendis Riverhorn in Blackrock Spire. Objective: Travel to Blackrock Spire and destroy the source of the worg menace. As you left Helendis, he shouted a name: Halycon. It is what the orcs refer to in regards to the worg.",zone="Blackrock Spire",questName="Put Her Down",lore="You have no doubt seen the worgs which the Blackrock orcs command. It is curious - no matter how many we destroy, their numbers never dwindle."},
    [15827]={name="Jadescale Breastplate",quality=2,ilvl=59,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Put Her Down'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Helendis Riverhorn in Blackrock Spire. Objective: Travel to Blackrock Spire and destroy the source of the worg menace. As you left Helendis, he shouted a name: Halycon. It is what the orcs refer to in regards to the worg.",zone="Blackrock Spire",questName="Put Her Down",lore="You have no doubt seen the worgs which the Blackrock orcs command. It is curious - no matter how many we destroy, their numbers never dwindle."},
    [15855]={name="Ring of Protection",quality=3,ilvl=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Hidden Treasures'. Starts with Pamela Redpath in Eastern Plaguelands. Objective: Bring Joseph's Key to Joseph's Chest.",zone="Eastern Plaguelands",questName="Hidden Treasures",lore="Daddy told me to give you this key. He said it opens a chest out back behind the house. He also wanted me to thank you. Did you do a favor for him?"},
    [15856]={name="Archlight Talisman",quality=3,ilvl=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Hidden Treasures'. Starts with Pamela Redpath in Eastern Plaguelands. Objective: Bring Joseph's Key to Joseph's Chest.",zone="Eastern Plaguelands",questName="Hidden Treasures",lore="Daddy told me to give you this key. He said it opens a chest out back behind the house. He also wanted me to thank you. Did you do a favor for him?"},
    [15859]={name="Seapost Girdle",quality=2,ilvl=59,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Bijou's Reconnaissance Report'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Badlands. Objective: Take Bijou's Reconnaissance Report back to Grandmaster Lexlort in Kargath.",zone="Blackrock Spire",questName="Bijou's Reconnaissance Report",lore="Take this report back to Lexlort. It will redeem my good name and will surely give the K.E.F. a strategic advantage in dealing with these orcs."},
    [15861]={name="Swiftfoot Treads",quality=2,ilvl=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Delivery to Ridgewell'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Mayara Brightwing in Stormwind City. Objective: Bring Ridgewell's Crate to Remington Ridgewell in Stormwind.",zone="Blackrock Spire",questName="Delivery to Ridgewell",lore="I have packaged Doomriggers Clasp into a crate, suitable for shipment to Stormwind., you have been extremely helpful -- can I ask you for one last favor?"},
    [15865]={name="Anchorhold Buckler",quality=2,ilvl=39,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Ghost-o-plasm Round Up'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Hornizz Brimbuzzle in Desolace. Objective: Bring 8 Ghost-o-plasms and the Crate of Ghost Magnets to Hornizz Brimbuzzle in Desolace.",zone="Desolace",questName="Ghost-o-plasm Round Up",lore="There's a valley to the southeast, the Valley of Bones, haunted by Magram ghosts. Sounds scary, doesn't it? Well think how scary it is to the Magram!"},
    [15890]={name="Vanguard Shield",quality=2,ilvl=59,reqLevel=54,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop around level 38-61."},
    [15891]={name="Hulking Shield",quality=2,ilvl=26,reqLevel=21,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop around level 21-27."},
