    [18807]={name="Helm of Latent Power",quality=3,ilvl=62,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Darkreaver Menace'. Starts with Sagorne Creststrider in Orgrimmar. Objective: Use the Divination Scryer in the heart of the Great Ossuary's basement in the Scholomance. Doing so will bring forth spirits you must fight. Defeating these spirits will summon forth Death Knight Darkreaver; defeat him.Bring Darkreaver's Head to Sagorne Creststrider in the Valley of Wisdom, Orgrimmar.",zone="Orgrimmar",questName="The Darkreaver Menace",lore="Death Knight Darkreaver lords over the Great Ossuary in the Scholomance. He threatens to twist the spirit realm to do his own bidding, and he must be stopped!"},
    [18814]={name="Choker of the Fire Lord",quality=4,ilvl=78,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Ragnaros.",npc="Ragnaros",lore="The Firelord, one of the four Elemental Lords, bound to the Elemental Plane until the Dark Iron dwarves summoned him under Blackrock Mountain. The summoning cracked the mountain open and made the Molten Core."},
    [18879]={name="Heavy Dark Iron Ring",quality=4,ilvl=66,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Gehennas.",zone="Molten Core",npc="Gehennas",lore="A hound handler of Ragnaros's court, who curses healing shut before the fighting starts."},
    [18948]={name="Barbaric Bracers",quality=3,ilvl=32,reqLevel=27,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Leatherworking (requires skill 1).",profession="Leatherworking"},
    [19024]={name="Arena Grand Master",quality=3,ilvl=55,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Arena Grandmaster'. Starts with Short John Mithril in Stranglethorn Vale. Objective: ProgressAvast Lubber! &nbsp; Bring me 12 trinkets of the Arena Master and then ye shall be a Grandmaster of the Gurubashi Arena! &nbsp; Arrrr!",zone="Stranglethorn Vale",questName="Arena Grandmaster",lore="Avast Lubber! Bring me 12 trinkets of the Arena Master and then ye shall be a Grandmaster of the Gurubashi Arena!",proc="Use: Absorbs 750 to 1250 damage. Â Lasts 20 sec. (15 Min Cooldown)"},
    [19038]={name="Ring of Subtlety",quality=2,ilvl=48,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Zukk'ash Report'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Hadoken Swiftstrider in Orgrimmar. Objective: Deliver the Camp Mojache Zukk'ash Report to Zilzibin Drumlore. He resides in the Drag of Orgrimmar.",zone="Feralas",questName="Zukk'ash Report",lore="You've done doubly well in addressing the threat that the Zukk'ash insects pose to Camp Mojache. The threat these things pose is far from over, and I'd like to ask you for one last task on behalf of the Horde."},
    [19039]={name="Zorbin's Water Resistant Hat",quality=2,ilvl=48,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Fuel for the Zapping'. Starts with Zorbin Fandazzle in Feralas. Objective: Collect 10 Water Elemental Cores from the Sea Elementals and Sea Sprays along the Forgotten Coast of Feralas, and bring them back to Zorbin Fandazzle who is near the dock there.",zone="Feralas",questName="Fuel for the Zapping",lore="When doing this though, be sure to save me the water elemental cores!"},
    [19041]={name="Pratt's Handcrafted Tunic",quality=2,ilvl=48,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Improved Quality'. Starts with Pratt McGrubben in Feralas. Objective: Bring 10 Rage Scar Yeti Hides to Pratt McGrubben at Feathermoon Stronghold, Feralas.",zone="Feralas",questName="Improved Quality",lore="I have a lead on an even BETTER source of hides, if that's even possible to believe! In the northern parts of Feralas - deep within Rage Scar Hold - are another throng of yetis."},
    [19042]={name="Jangdor's Handcrafted Tunic",quality=2,ilvl=48,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Improved Quality'. Starts with Pratt McGrubben in Feralas. Objective: Bring 10 Rage Scar Yeti Hides to Pratt McGrubben at Feathermoon Stronghold, Feralas.",zone="Feralas",questName="Improved Quality",lore="I have a lead on an even BETTER source of hides, if that's even possible to believe! In the northern parts of Feralas - deep within Rage Scar Hold - are another throng of yetis."},
