    [21836]={name="Ritssyn's Ring of Chaos",quality=4,ilvl=71,reqLevel=60,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop around level 60-62."},
    [21837]={name="Anubisath Warhammer",quality=4,ilvl=71,reqLevel=60,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop around level 60-62."},
    [21839]={name="Scepter of the False Prophet",quality=4,ilvl=84,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from C'Thun.",zone="Temple of Ahn'Qiraj",npc="C'Thun",lore="An Old God, buried under Ahn'Qiraj by the titans rather than killed. It has been whispering to the qiraji ever since, and the whole war exists because it never stopped."},
    [22095]={name="Bindings of The Five Thunders",quality=3,ilvl=65,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'An Earnest Proposition'. Starts with Deliana in Ironforge. Objective: Acquire 15 Winterspring Blood Samples and 20 gold and bring them along with a set of Lightforge Bracers to Deliana in Ironforge.",zone="Orgrimmar",questName="An Earnest Proposition",lore="Hail! I can tell by your demeanor that you've seen and done much in this world. Yet I'm willing to wager you haven't seen a piece of armor like this."},
    [22096]={name="Boots of The Five Thunders",quality=4,ilvl=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Anthion's Parting Words'. Objective: Return to Mokvar in Orgimmar with a set of Dreadmist Sandals, Dreadmist Leggings and Dreadmist Mantle.",zone="Orgrimmar",questName="Anthion's Parting Words",lore="Valthalak's soul was stored in this amulet. In our greed we foolishly split it into three parts, not knowing the curse that would await us. The only way to stop Valthalak's spell is to put the amulet back together."},
    [22097]={name="Coif of The Five Thunders",quality=4,ilvl=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Saving the Best for Last'. Starts with Deliana in Ironforge. Objective: Give Deliana your Helm of Valor and Breastplate of Valor.",zone="Orgrimmar",questName="Saving the Best for Last",lore="A truly amazing story! You have my thanks, and the heartfelt gratitude of all who were involved, I can assure you. Through your efforts we are delivered from the mistakes of our past."},
    [22098]={name="Cord of The Five Thunders",quality=3,ilvl=65,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Just Compensation'. Starts with Mokvar in Orgrimmar. Objective: Bring a Shadowcraft Belt and a set of Shadowcraft Gloves to Mokvar in Orgrimmar.",zone="Orgrimmar",questName="Just Compensation",lore="You've proven to be a very reliable individual. As much as I trust that you'll help me through this predicament, it would be wise of me to reward you according to your performance."},
    [22099]={name="Gauntlets of The Five Thunders",quality=4,ilvl=55,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Just Compensation'. Starts with Mokvar in Orgrimmar. Objective: Bring a Shadowcraft Belt and a set of Shadowcraft Gloves to Mokvar in Orgrimmar.",zone="Orgrimmar",questName="Just Compensation",lore="For now I will exchange your belt and gauntlets."},
    [22100]={name="Kilt of The Five Thunders",quality=3,ilvl=66,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Anthion's Parting Words'. Objective: Return to Mokvar in Orgimmar with a set of Dreadmist Sandals, Dreadmist Leggings and Dreadmist Mantle.",zone="Orgrimmar",questName="Anthion's Parting Words",lore="Valthalak's soul was stored in this amulet. In our greed we foolishly split it into three parts, not knowing the curse that would await us. The only way to stop Valthalak's spell is to put the amulet back together."},
    [22101]={name="Pauldrons of The Five Thunders",quality=3,ilvl=65,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Anthion's Parting Words'. Objective: Return to Mokvar in Orgimmar with a set of Dreadmist Sandals, Dreadmist Leggings and Dreadmist Mantle.",zone="Orgrimmar",questName="Anthion's Parting Words",lore="Valthalak's soul was stored in this amulet. In our greed we foolishly split it into three parts, not knowing the curse that would await us. The only way to stop Valthalak's spell is to put the amulet back together."},
    [22102]={name="Vest of The Five Thunders",quality=4,ilvl=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Saving the Best for Last'. Starts with Deliana in Ironforge. Objective: Give Deliana your Helm of Valor and Breastplate of Valor.",zone="Orgrimmar",questName="Saving the Best for Last",lore="A truly amazing story! You have my thanks, and the heartfelt gratitude of all who were involved, I can assure you. Through your efforts we are delivered from the mistakes of our past."},
    [22149]={name="Beads of Ogre Mojo",quality=3,ilvl=63,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Falrin's Vendetta'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Falrin Treeshaper in Dire Maul. Objective: Collect 25 Ogre Warbeads from Ogres inside Dire Maul or Blackrock Spire and return to Falrin Treeshaper inside the Athenaeum in Dire Maul.",zone="Dire Maul",questName="Falrin's Vendetta",lore="Yet I'm not one to give out favors freely, even if you were sent here by an old friend. I hold nothing but hatred and contempt for our brutish ogre neighbors."},
    [22150]={name="Beads of Ogre Might",quality=3,ilvl=63,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Falrin's Vendetta'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Falrin Treeshaper in Dire Maul. Objective: Collect 25 Ogre Warbeads from Ogres inside Dire Maul or Blackrock Spire and return to Falrin Treeshaper inside the Athenaeum in Dire Maul.",zone="Dire Maul",questName="Falrin's Vendetta",lore="Yet I'm not one to give out favors freely, even if you were sent here by an old friend. I hold nothing but hatred and contempt for our brutish ogre neighbors."},
